  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "0.5 medium white onion, diced",
    "3 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 tablespoon capers",
    "1 tablespoon caper juice",
    "1 cup cherry tomatoes, halved",
    "0.33333334326744 cup pitted, sliced green olives (such as Castelvetrano)",
    "1 medium jalapeno pepper, seeded and chopped",
    "2 teaspoons chopped fresh oregano",
    "2 teaspoons olive oil",
    "2 (7 ounce) red snapper fillets",
    "0.5 teaspoon cayenne pepper, or more to taste",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "2 medium limes, juiced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_F07D5Kbz9VZuCqqP6regQ0sm_w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-243-4x3-step-01-e4186858caaf43b6967a7efa10f1275c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the sauce: Heat oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until translucent, 6 to 7 minutes. Stir in garlic and cook until fragrant, about 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SO0KzLX1zsSJ5kTHcEGobJeqnj8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-246-4x3-step-02-33dee8b731ca4fb78ac9714687c80717.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in capers and caper juice. Add tomatoes, olives, and jalapeño; cook and stir until tomatoes begin to collapse and jalapeño softens, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lUOhpwfJ7Ier9-_UHCTfEBiQIrI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-250-4x3-step-03-6824b10c7e0649dca4b22d304d20ed16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat and stir in oregano.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jyJJ253-HPapO4GEK6Qh7iUQV4o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-251-4x3-step-04-0285e1dfdefe4f118d5e92266c407eb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the snapper: Brush 1 teaspoon oil over the bottom of two small baking dishes. In each dish, add 1 tablespoon sauce, followed by a snapper fillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fYaWXtaXW1ARxzBtFvhBRE55IOQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-257-4x3-step-06-93ca8f1aaa8d461d97e19467033fd291.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper. Cover with more sauce, then drizzle lime juice over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/30MHjyjrCu1fDo8F6NMPvho-S-I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-261-4x3-step-09-00699a0e7a474a089fe29bc6eba6f2c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until fish flakes easily with a fork, 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QI5Liq4xW0KnG-2rn_s4qxn4hrc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228046-veracruz-style-red-snapper-DDMFS-262-4x3-step-10-48074b6dd61d43b08baab3449d7b451b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228046/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
